---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import TextPage from '../components/TextPage.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Contact — KAVOVO"
  description="How to reach KAVOVO with questions, recipe corrections or partnership enquiries."
>
  <TextPage
    eyebrow="Contact"
    title="Talk to us"
    intro="Questions about a recipe, a correction, or something you'd like us to cover — all of it is welcome."
  >
    <h2>Email</h2>
    <p>
      <a href="mailto:hello@kavovo.uk">hello@kavovo.uk</a> reaches us directly. We read everything and usually
      reply within a few working days.
    </p>

    <h2>Recipe corrections</h2>
    <p>
      If a recipe didn't work for you, tell us what equipment you used and what the cup tasted like. That's usually
      enough for us to reproduce the problem and fix the instructions.
    </p>

    <h2>Press and partnerships</h2>
    <p>
      Use the same address and mention what you have in mind. We don't publish paid reviews or sponsored recipes.
    </p>

    <h2>Newsletter</h2>
    <p>
      For weekly recipes and guides, subscribe from the <a href="/#newsletter">homepage</a>. We explain what we do with
      your address in the <a href="/privacy/">privacy notice</a>.
    </p>
  </TextPage>
</Layout>
